  "title": "Grandma&#39;s Red Hot Southern Sweet Potatoes",
  "description": "Sweet potatoes are baked with brown sugar and red hot cinnamon candies. My grandmother used to make this simple sweet-spicy dish every year for the holidays. It&#39;s so delicious, you&#39;ll want to make it all year.",
